// The invasion's vehicles (openspec/changes/invasion-forces, design section 1). Placeholder
// numbers, first estimates to be retuned from a run's MISSION log. First run (2026-10-24): with
// a 35 hp tank shell every 4 s and 20 hp rockets the pilot fell 90 s into wave 1; halved, then
// (for the full three-wave take, 2026-10-24) tank 10, rockets 5 every 16 s, fighter cannon 2.
// Helicopter rockets 100 mm, not 120: at 120 they beat a mech's legs (120 mm) and took one off within
// a minute (32 hits of the pilot's 101 in a counted run); now they hurt arms and heads only. Armour is one value per unit
// for now (no front or side): the pilot's 35 mm autocannon (90 mm) beats everything but a tank's
// hull slowly, the 120 mm cannon (260 mm) beats all of them. Weapons are `WeaponSpec`s, as a
// mech's: `socket` and `arm` are unused on a unit (it fires from its nose).
(
    units: {
        "tank": (
            kind: Tank,
            size_m: (3.6, 2.6, 7.0),
            speed_m_s: 12.0,
            turn_deg_s: 30.0,
            hp: 220.0,
            armour_mm: 80.0,
            weapon: Some((name: "120 mm tank gun", socket: "NOSE", arm: Torso, group: 0, speed_m_s: 900.0,
                interval_s: 6.0, penetration_mm: 200.0, damage: 6.0, blast_mj: 3.0)),
            fire_range_m: 1200.0,
            fire_cone_deg: 3.0,
